\p{The finite cards listed in \ref{ftip-00I7}--\ref{ftip-00IM}, \ref{ftip-00IU}, and \ref{ftip-00J1}--\ref{ftip-00J2} satisfy the release criterion of \ref{ftip-00J5} after their prerequisite cards are imported.}
